# Dawn of Death (abyssea 162), the maw list: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its story quests
# before it and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie with 333). The section counts the nine maw
# quests of its list (1 A Goldstruck Gigas, 2 To Paste a Peiste, 3 Megadrile Menace, 4 The Beast of Bastore, 5 A
# Delectable Demon, 6 A Fluttery Fiend, 7 A Beaked Blusterer, 8 A Man-eating Mite, 9 An Ulcerous Uragnite) and wants 3.
# Joachim with 2 of them completed (GMs), in 4 sets {2,4} {3,5} {6,8} {7,9}: no section each time: his script's 328.
# Each list entry n has a set holding n + 1 but not n (the last: one without 9; A Journey Begins, completed, stands
# after it), so an entry read as the next quest would count 3 there. Then 1 completed too: 3: 333, finished: completed,
# First Contact accepted.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/328 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/333
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
